WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
ANU. Learning is a journey. Make every step count. Learn, practice, progress.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Ultrasound learning, connected. Meet ANU. Your learning management system. Structured modules, interactive learning, progress tracking.

00:10.000 --> 00:18.000
A clear path. At every step. Courses, modules, and resources organized around the learner. An illustrative My Learning screen shows BPD and HC, AC, and FL modules with Learn, Practice, Interpret, and Test stages.

00:18.000 --> 00:25.000
Go beyond watching. Quizzes, interpretation, practice. MindSparks, OB Boosters, and practice activities. An illustrative panel highlights anatomical landmarks, probe movements, and image diagnosis.

00:25.000 --> 00:33.000
See progress. Find focus. Review attempts and scores, understand skill competency, and choose the next step. A sample dashboard shows modules completed, training time, practice streak, and attempt history. All values are illustrative.

00:33.000 --> 00:39.000
For learners. For educators. Coordinate batches and instructors. Keep the learning journey in view. An illustrative batch overview shows training modules and sample progress.

00:39.000 --> 00:45.000
ANU. Build the next chapter of ultrasound learning. One platform. A clearer learning journey. Discover ANU.
